      "message": "Stupid question:\n why can\u0027t throwAboveU if it is @UnsupportedAppUsage(maxTargetSdk \u003d O) ?\n Does it mean we\u0027ll need to keep compatibility for apps that built against O framework which run on an U device? If so can we say throwIfInitSdkAtLeastU?",
